---

<section id="my-way" class="s-my-way" data-intersect>
  <svg
    class="s__smiley js-smiley"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    viewBox="0 0 77.8 77.8"
    xml:space="preserve"
  >
